meta {
  name: 06_RolePackagesAndResources
  seq: 6
}

docs {
  Scenario: A role's packages and resources can be fetched by code or by id

    When a role's packages are fetched through the role and variant query
    And the same packages are fetched through the {id}/packages route
    And includeResources nests the resources behind each package
    When a role's resources are fetched through the role and variant query
    And the same resources are fetched through the {id}/resources route
    And includePackageResources widens the resource list
    When an unknown role code returns 404
    And an unknown variant returns 404
    When an unknown role id answers 200 with an empty list, not 404

  The scenario is read only and needs no cleanup.
}
